{"id":"52816700e55c6bea","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-many-one-reducible.md","title":"Many-One Reducibility","display":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-many-one-reducible","aliases":["90-df-many-one-reducible"],"display":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducibility","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-many-one-reducible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-many-one-reducible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 表示总递归一元数值函数，不是部分递归函数，也不是只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上定义的映射。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m\">\\(\\le_m\\)</span> 是本文件给出的二元集合关系；无需假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为 c.e.。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_m B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_m B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_m B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).","display":true}],"bytes":873,"backlinks":[{"id":"fcd465e3faf82dc1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\le_m$ 的关系定义直接取 [[90-df-many-one-reducible]]；其中全可计算函数与本书 $\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 由 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]] 的定义一致。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-many-one-reducible]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["137d75d038de4a47"]}